WEBVTT

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:04.180
He, Yuya Sakaki, is Z-ARC's reincarnation!

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:09.290
Only a duel can seal Z-ARC, who wields 
the power of Duel Monsters.

00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:12.520
No! I'm not a devil!

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:17.360
As leader of the Lancers, I will 
see my convictions through!

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:22.120
I will stop Leo Akaba's intrigues.

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:24.040
And I will do it with Yuya Sakaki!

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:32.040
I see that speech will do me no good.

00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:36.650
To restore the worlds to one, and to revive Ray,

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:39.400
I must destroy Yuya Sakaki myself.

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:41.620
Don't try to stop me, Reiji!

00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:45.940
Field Spell Crossover.

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:49.060
Duel!

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:54.770
In a world split into four dimensions,

00:00:54.770 --> 00:00:58.950
four boys exist, all with the same face.

00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:02.340
Their dragons call to each other,

00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:05.980
almost as if seeking one another.

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:44.010
Decisive Battle! Spirit Tech Force

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:47.390
The situation has grown dire.

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:48.750
Thus, sooner than expected,

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:53.220
I will begin the process to unite you as one.

00:02:54.160 --> 00:02:55.190
As one?

00:02:59.590 --> 00:03:03.220
Those capsules are connected to ARC-V.

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:14.170
The life energy cards, which the 
Academia Army has been collecting,

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:18.170
are being rapidly infused into ARC-V.

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:22.350
When that number reaches the necessary amount,

00:03:22.350 --> 00:03:25.950
ARC-V will begin its quickening

00:03:25.950 --> 00:03:29.550
and trigger sufficient power to 
subsume all four dimensions.

00:03:30.050 --> 00:03:33.160
Subsume all four dimensions?

00:03:33.590 --> 00:03:39.030
When that happens, the four girls 
will unite and be reborn as Ray!

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:42.330
Give me a break.

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:47.310
I don't know anything about ARC-V or Ray.

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:50.130
But you, who made Yuzu and the others suffer...

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:51.780
You, and you alone,

00:03:52.070 --> 00:03:53.750
will pay!

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:55.210
Yuya!

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:56.680
Ute...

00:03:56.930 --> 00:03:59.500
Reiji, let me go first.

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:00.390
Right.

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:02.850
Yuzu! I'm going to save you!

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:04.330
Yuya...

00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:09.140
That evil thing that lives deep in our hearts...

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:10.860
It must be Z-ARC.

00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:13.930
Yeah, so now we know.

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:17.210
Which means that, unless we 
lose ourselves to anger,

00:04:17.210 --> 00:04:19.010
Z-ARC won't revive.

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:19.900
That's right.

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:23.880
We must stop that machine and save 
the girls as soon as possible!

00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:27.200
I set the Pendulum Scale with 
Scale 1 Stargazer Magician

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:31.610
and Scale 8 Timegazer Magician!

00:04:37.950 --> 00:04:41.690
Now I can summon monsters between 
Levels 2 and 7 simultaneously!

00:04:43.130 --> 00:04:45.860
Swing, my soul's pendulum.

00:04:46.110 --> 00:04:48.600
Draw a shining arc in the sky!

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:50.370
Pendulum Summon!

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:51.510
Appear!

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:56.230
The heroic one with beautiful 
different-colored eyes,

00:04:56.710 --> 00:04:59.260
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:05:01.510 --> 00:05:03.480
Odd-Eyes Dragon...

00:05:11.460 --> 00:05:14.000
Smiles are more precious than anything.

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:18.700
I instilled that principle in Yuya 
from a very young age.

00:05:23.890 --> 00:05:25.840
Laugh when you want to cry.

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:28.090
Laugh with all your might.

00:05:28.870 --> 00:05:31.980
Throughout your life, hard things will happen.

00:05:31.980 --> 00:05:36.250
When that occurs, you'll need the courage 
to face adversity with a smile.

00:05:36.930 --> 00:05:40.880
That boy... Yuya can do it, I'm sure.

00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:45.190
My dream to use duels to bring 
smiles to the people of the world...

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:46.700
He'll see it through.

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:51.720
But since when?

00:05:57.110 --> 00:05:58.860
Sorry, hold on one second.

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:00.910
Since when?

00:06:00.910 --> 00:06:02.310
Since when what?

00:06:02.310 --> 00:06:05.680
You've been taking care of that baby alone.

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:06.650
Where's your wife?

00:06:06.650 --> 00:06:08.510
Really, sir...

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:11.280
Are you trying to dig up old memories?

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:14.160
Certainly not. I'm sorry.

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:18.170
It's all right. I've forgotten, somehow.

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:22.380
I've started to think that maybe 
she never had a mother,

00:06:22.380 --> 00:06:25.530
that Yuzu was just a gift from god.

00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:27.640
Is that funny?

00:06:27.640 --> 00:06:31.290
At the time, I didn't consider it more deeply.

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:34.250
But looking back now,

00:06:34.250 --> 00:06:36.980
I have no solid memories of it.

00:06:38.070 --> 00:06:43.130
When she learned she was pregnant, 
what did I say to congratulate her?

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:46.830
When Yuya was born... 
Where was I? What was I doing?

00:06:47.220 --> 00:06:48.350
Can it be?

00:06:48.350 --> 00:06:52.460
Do I lack memories of these things 
because they never happened?

00:06:53.280 --> 00:06:56.120
I won't let the Aquaria Project succeed.

00:06:56.120 --> 00:06:58.120
I won't let you create ARC-V!

00:06:58.120 --> 00:06:59.930
I'll defeat you first!

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:02.130
I now end my turn!

00:07:02.130 --> 00:07:03.640
My turn!

00:07:05.080 --> 00:07:08.880
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 1 
D/D Savant Copernicus

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:13.630
and Scale 6 D/D Cerberus!

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:24.010
Now I can summon monsters between 
Levels 2 and 5 simultaneously.

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:28.290
The great power that shakes my soul,

00:07:28.290 --> 00:07:32.530
reside in my body and become the new 
light that cuts through the darkness!

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:34.300
Pendulum Summon.

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:39.600
Appear, grotesque god with 
black wings, D/D Berfomet!

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:44.980
And Tuner Monster, D/D Ghost!

00:07:45.260 --> 00:07:46.950
Tuner Monster?

00:07:46.950 --> 00:07:50.920
I also Normal Summon 
D/D Necro Slime from my hand.

00:07:53.770 --> 00:07:54.960
It's coming.

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:57.120
The chain summoning Reiji's so good at!

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:59.900
Level 2 D/D Ghost

00:07:59.900 --> 00:08:04.830
tunes Level 4 D/D Berfomet and 
Level 1 D/D Necro Slime!

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:09.030
The roar that cuts through the darkness,

00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:13.610
gain the speed of a gale and 
give rise to a new king!

00:08:13.610 --> 00:08:15.310
Synchro Summon.

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:21.280
Be born, Level 7 D/D/D Gust King Alexander!

00:08:21.530 --> 00:08:23.250
Synchro Summon...

00:08:23.720 --> 00:08:25.580
It isn't over yet.

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:28.490
Reiji Akaba can use all the summoning methods.

00:08:28.490 --> 00:08:30.960
Fusion and Xyz, as well.

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:35.390
Using the effect of the D/D Ghost 
sent to my graveyard,

00:08:35.390 --> 00:08:38.990
I select D/D Berfomet, which accompanied it,

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:42.940
and send one card with the same name 
from my deck to the graveyard.

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:47.840
I also activate the effect of the 
D/D Necro Slime in my graveyard.

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:52.220
I banish this card and D/D Ghost from my 
graveyard to use them as fusion components,

00:08:52.220 --> 00:08:55.750
and I Fusion Summon one D/D/D Fusion Monster!

00:08:56.310 --> 00:08:59.580
Swirl of secrets that changes forms at will,

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:02.110
engulf the spirit that dwells in darkness,

00:09:02.110 --> 00:09:05.520
become one, and give birth to the new king!

00:09:06.070 --> 00:09:07.490
Fusion Summon.

00:09:07.820 --> 00:09:12.960
Be born, Level 6 D/D/D Flame King Genghis!

00:09:12.960 --> 00:09:15.700
Synchro, Fusion, and next...

00:09:15.960 --> 00:09:19.170
D/D/D Gust King Alexander's effect activates.

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:24.000
When I summon or Special Summon a 
D/D monster to my side of the field,

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:28.630
I can Special Summon one D/D monster, 
Level 4 or below, from my graveyard.

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:31.820
Be reborn, D/D Berfomet!

00:09:34.060 --> 00:09:37.020
And I use D/D/D Genghis's effect

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:40.990
to Special Summon the other D/D 
Berfomet from the graveyard!

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:45.430
Now, he has two Level 4 monsters.

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:50.170
I overlay the two Level 4 D/D Berfomets!

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:58.240
In order to rule all of existence, 
descend at the world's spire!

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:00.210
Xyz Summon.

00:10:00.210 --> 00:10:05.180
Be born, Rank 4 D/D/D Wave King Caesar!

00:10:06.650 --> 00:10:08.120
Amazing.

00:10:08.490 --> 00:10:12.360
From Pendulum to Synchro, Fusion, and Xyz.

00:10:12.640 --> 00:10:16.330
You've powered up a bit since 
I saw you last, Reiji.

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:18.720
Act impressed later!

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:23.300
I activate Continuous Spell Dark Contract 
with Exclusivity from my hand!

00:10:23.920 --> 00:10:28.170
When you Special Summon a monster 
from your Extra Deck to your field,

00:10:28.170 --> 00:10:33.000
if a monster Special Summoned with 
the same method is on my field,

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:34.910
I can negate that summon!

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:36.720
I see.

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:40.120
It seems you weren't just
 charging forth recklessly.

00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:46.620
On my side of the field are Fusion, 
Synchro, and Xyz Monsters.

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:50.730
I've sealed all three summoning 
methods from your arsenal!

00:10:50.980 --> 00:10:54.670
Yes! That really limits the Professor's actions!

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:55.930
This might just work!

00:10:56.190 --> 00:10:58.400
I now end my turn.

00:10:58.400 --> 00:11:00.800
Now, try me, Leo Akaba...

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:04.640
If you think you can break through 
my iron wall, go ahead and try!

00:11:05.990 --> 00:11:07.650
You appear quite confident.

00:11:08.540 --> 00:11:09.910
My turn.

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:13.380
Reiji, Yuya Sakaki is a piece of Z-ARC!

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:16.850
The Supreme King dwells inside him.

00:11:17.220 --> 00:11:21.230
Surely, you cannot deny this truth anymore.

00:11:21.230 --> 00:11:22.830
Then, you want me to join you?

00:11:22.830 --> 00:11:25.590
Yes. Defeat him with—

00:11:25.590 --> 00:11:28.030
I have already told you my intention.

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:30.810
I will fight alongside Yuya.

00:11:31.240 --> 00:11:33.770
Even if Z-ARC is reborn

00:11:33.770 --> 00:11:37.210
and tries to drive the world 
to destruction once more?

00:11:37.720 --> 00:11:39.610
I won't destroy it!

00:11:39.610 --> 00:11:43.180
As long as Ute and I are here, 
Z-ARC will never be reborn!

00:11:43.610 --> 00:11:46.160
Even if Yuya is a piece of Z-ARC,

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:49.520
that only matters if he's reunited with the others.

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:54.730
If the constructed ARC-V dimension isn't 
united, Z-ARC will never be reborn.

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:57.930
And the four dimensions' peace will be preserved.

00:11:58.200 --> 00:12:00.630
He is my ally!

00:12:01.460 --> 00:12:02.490
Reiji...

00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:09.210
For your ego's sake, you created 
this chance for Z-ARC's revival!

00:12:09.560 --> 00:12:15.130
Even if I do not create ARC-V, 
Z-ARC will still, someday, revive

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:17.180
by Z-ARC's own will.

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:22.150
His double from the Xyz Dimension 
already possesses Yuya Sakaki.

00:12:22.520 --> 00:12:25.620
I must stop the resurrection of that devil.

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:29.590
That isn't so! True, Ute is inside me!

00:12:29.960 --> 00:12:34.300
But like me, Ute wants to use 
his duel to create smiles!

00:12:34.870 --> 00:12:38.270
Even if something evil is deep within us,

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:40.770
we can hold it back, together!

00:12:40.770 --> 00:12:43.980
Together, we'll protect Yuzu and the others!

00:12:43.980 --> 00:12:45.440
Yuya!

00:12:45.880 --> 00:12:47.830
Bring smiles with duels.

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:51.090
Ute remembers the promise he made me...

00:12:51.090 --> 00:12:53.450
even after things have reached this point.

00:12:54.130 --> 00:12:57.720
Ruri, your words have given 
me so much support.

00:12:57.720 --> 00:13:01.430
Then, let me show you my power...

00:13:01.740 --> 00:13:04.220
With a duel that will crush you!

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:09.830
I set the Pendulum Scale with 
two Scale 1 Spirit Reactors!

00:13:12.170 --> 00:13:13.080
What?

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:14.220
Leo Akaba...

00:13:14.220 --> 00:13:15.370
...used Pendulum?!

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:23.210
But...

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:27.420
He can't Pendulum Summon 
with two Scale 1 monsters.

00:13:28.890 --> 00:13:34.130
I activate the Pendulum Effect of the 
left Pendulum Scale's Spirit Reactor!

00:13:34.130 --> 00:13:39.330
I choose one Pendulum Card on the 
field, setting its scale to match.

00:13:39.610 --> 00:13:42.570
I select Timegazer Magician.

00:13:42.570 --> 00:13:43.800
What?

00:13:44.060 --> 00:13:47.440
Timegazer Magician's Pendulum Scale is 8.

00:13:47.440 --> 00:13:48.510
Which means...

00:13:50.570 --> 00:13:51.580
Yes.

00:13:51.580 --> 00:13:55.450
That means I can summon monsters between 
Levels 2 and 7 simultaneously.

00:13:55.750 --> 00:13:57.980
Spirit who dwells in heaven and earth,

00:13:57.980 --> 00:14:02.650
purify our sin-stained hands and lay the 
foundation for the world's rebirth.

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:04.360
Pendulum Summon.

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:09.330
Appear, Spirit Tech Force — Pendulum Governor!

00:14:09.330 --> 00:14:12.830
And Spirit Gem — Salamander Core!

00:14:14.780 --> 00:14:18.250
He copied my Pendulum Scale?

00:14:23.240 --> 00:14:25.710
I activate Pendulum Governor's effect!

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:30.110
To use that effect twice, 
I tribute Salamander Core.

00:14:30.460 --> 00:14:31.820
Are you ready?

00:14:32.190 --> 00:14:37.130
By tributing Salamander Core, I can 
destroy one monster on the field,

00:14:37.130 --> 00:14:41.790
dealing its player 800 points of damage.

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:43.760
My first target for destruction

00:14:44.140 --> 00:14:48.630
is that servant of the wretched devil, 
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:14:53.300 --> 00:14:54.130
Yuya!

00:14:54.130 --> 00:14:54.790
Yuya!

00:14:56.010 --> 00:14:57.480
Next up, Reiji,

00:14:57.840 --> 00:14:58.780
is you!

00:15:04.620 --> 00:15:09.560
The destruction of Genghis means 
that I can now perform fusions

00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:13.290
that Dark Contract with Exclusivity 
previously sealed.

00:15:13.560 --> 00:15:19.260
Reiji, that means that iron wall of yours 
already has a seam that's bursting.

00:15:19.260 --> 00:15:23.960
But I still have Alexander and Caesar.

00:15:23.960 --> 00:15:25.680
I won't let you—

00:15:25.680 --> 00:15:28.470
I will not let you have your way.

00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:31.130
Pendulum Governor's effect means

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:34.650
that any monsters within the scale 
of the Pendulum I set...

00:15:35.170 --> 00:15:39.980
In other words, attacks by all monsters 
between Levels 2 and 7 are sealed.

00:15:39.980 --> 00:15:42.070
Alexander is Level 7.

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:44.860
But Caesar is an Xyz Monster.

00:15:44.860 --> 00:15:46.360
It doesn't have a level!

00:15:46.360 --> 00:15:51.100
Only Pendulum Monsters may 
attack Pendulum Governor!

00:15:52.100 --> 00:15:53.920
Do you see now?

00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:56.600
There is nothing you can do.

00:15:56.910 --> 00:15:59.610
No one will interrupt my plan.

00:15:59.610 --> 00:16:02.540
And I will stop the resurrection of that devil!

00:16:04.280 --> 00:16:07.620
I set one card and end my turn.

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:14.720
I praise your leadership in guiding 
the Lancers to me.

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:18.510
But you seem to have had only 
one plan for fighting Academia,

00:16:18.510 --> 00:16:23.960
and failed to consider what might happen 
if your opponent had a better plan.

00:16:24.400 --> 00:16:28.430
As a chief strategist, you have much to learn!

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:36.110
Was that really Yuya?

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:38.460
Ute is inside Yuya.

00:16:39.090 --> 00:16:43.080
Yuya does have mysterious power, 
but that was unusual.

00:16:43.450 --> 00:16:46.880
Do you think he was being 
controlled by the Doctor?

00:16:46.880 --> 00:16:48.760
Regardless, we have to go after him.

00:16:48.760 --> 00:16:49.610
Yeah.

00:16:56.270 --> 00:16:57.070
No!

00:16:57.070 --> 00:16:57.930
What's going on?

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:01.370
Yuya!

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:02.380
Yuzu!

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:03.330
Ruri!

00:17:03.600 --> 00:17:08.870
It is only a matter of time until ARC-V 
gains enough energy to revive.

00:17:09.310 --> 00:17:12.280
No... Yuya!

00:17:12.280 --> 00:17:13.980
Yuzu!

00:17:13.980 --> 00:17:16.270
Ray's resurrection nears.

00:17:16.270 --> 00:17:18.450
At last, the day has come!

00:17:18.860 --> 00:17:20.650
Save me, Ute!

00:17:20.650 --> 00:17:22.020
Ruri!

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:22.990
Stop it!

00:17:23.530 --> 00:17:26.940
Stop it!

00:17:27.710 --> 00:17:30.160
Reiji, it isn't too late.

00:17:30.550 --> 00:17:35.960
If you would only swear to work with me 
to restore the separated dimensions...

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:37.580
Separated?

00:17:38.980 --> 00:17:41.410
And who's the one who separated them?

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:42.870
That's...

00:17:43.270 --> 00:17:44.280
Yuya!

00:17:47.110 --> 00:17:49.080
Yuya! What's wrong?

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:53.360
I only did as they wanted.

00:17:53.360 --> 00:17:57.560
I fought more strongly and more violently!

00:18:01.520 --> 00:18:04.230
Yuya... Yuya's anger...

00:18:06.200 --> 00:18:07.840
That is Z-ARC!

00:18:07.840 --> 00:18:11.640
The voice of the devil duelist that 
lives inside Yuya Sakaki!

00:18:11.640 --> 00:18:12.920
Z-ARC?

00:18:12.920 --> 00:18:14.870
It isn't true. That can't be true!

00:18:16.410 --> 00:18:17.720
Look, Reiji!

00:18:17.720 --> 00:18:20.310
Will you protect Yuya Sakaki, even now?

00:18:20.760 --> 00:18:25.280
Do you want to revive the devil and 
allow the world to be destroyed?

00:18:25.720 --> 00:18:27.770
Now is the time to finish it.

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:29.430
Work with me

00:18:29.430 --> 00:18:31.990
to stop that devil's revival!

00:18:33.440 --> 00:18:36.480
Do not forget yourself... You are Yuya Sakaki.

00:18:36.480 --> 00:18:37.700
Not a devil!

00:18:37.980 --> 00:18:39.900
R-Reiji...

00:18:41.960 --> 00:18:46.810
From deep... in my heart, it's welling up...

00:18:47.280 --> 00:18:49.810
But... But it isn't...

00:18:53.310 --> 00:18:56.840
Yeah, we're... we're still okay.

00:18:56.840 --> 00:19:02.440
We've held him back so... many times before.

00:19:03.430 --> 00:19:07.340
So this time, as well... we will...

00:19:07.340 --> 00:19:08.960
We will...

00:19:09.480 --> 00:19:10.490
win!

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:13.100
My turn!

00:19:13.470 --> 00:19:15.070
Leo said

00:19:15.070 --> 00:19:18.120
Z-ARC was split by Ray

00:19:18.120 --> 00:19:21.070
and reincarnated into each 
of the four dimensions.

00:19:21.070 --> 00:19:25.440
I use the Pendulum Scale already 
set, to Pendulum Summon.

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:30.090
Be reborn from my Extra Deck, 
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:19:31.820 --> 00:19:35.290
And Performapal U Go Golem from my hand!

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:39.720
Leo Akaba!

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:43.930
Stop that machine right now! Free the girls!

00:19:44.320 --> 00:19:48.410
But Z-ARC is now trying to reintegrate himself.

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:49.900
For what purpose?

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:54.370
On the turn that I successfully 
Pendulum Summon U Go Golem,

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:59.310
I can Fusion Summon by sending this card 
and a component monster to my graveyard.

00:19:59.720 --> 00:20:02.110
You, who frightened Yuzu...

00:20:02.110 --> 00:20:03.780
I will defeat you!

00:20:05.690 --> 00:20:07.650
Dragon with different-colored eyes,

00:20:07.650 --> 00:20:10.490
become one with the giant born of the land,

00:20:10.490 --> 00:20:13.220
and be reborn with a different form!

00:20:13.220 --> 00:20:14.960
Fusion Summon!

00:20:15.330 --> 00:20:20.060
Appear, Level 8 Performapal Gatlinghoul!

00:20:21.040 --> 00:20:22.580
It's obvious.

00:20:22.580 --> 00:20:25.400
To retake the person he used to be.

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:28.910
When I successfully Fusion Summon Gatlinghoul,

00:20:28.910 --> 00:20:34.730
for each card on the field, I deal 
you 200 points of damage!

00:20:34.730 --> 00:20:35.580
What?

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:41.110
He was the ultimate duelist. 
The duelist who reigned over all others.

00:20:41.110 --> 00:20:42.550
To restore that part of himself...

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:46.260
Right now, twelve cards are on the field.

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:51.660
Take that damage twelve times!

00:20:53.420 --> 00:20:54.870
In that case...

00:21:08.550 --> 00:21:10.280
Yuya!

00:21:10.280 --> 00:21:14.750
Did Z-ARC choose me to 
revive him as a duelist?

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:23.190
He made me raise his double and 
teach him dueling from scratch

00:21:23.190 --> 00:21:25.900
to hasten his reawakening?

00:21:25.900 --> 00:21:27.290
Yuya!

00:21:27.630 --> 00:21:29.750
Yuya...

00:21:31.730 --> 00:21:32.570
Layra!

00:21:32.570 --> 00:21:35.230
This turn, Performapal Gatlinghoul

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:38.540
was Fusion Summoned, using Pendulum 
Monsters as components.

00:21:38.990 --> 00:21:41.510
Meaning it can activate its second effect.

00:21:41.510 --> 00:21:44.220
I destroy Pendulum Governor,

00:21:44.220 --> 00:21:48.950
and deal its attack points, 
2800, as damage to you!

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:50.950
Leo Akaba has 1600 life!

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:52.920
If this hit goes through...

00:21:52.920 --> 00:21:54.890
...Yuya will win.

00:21:58.140 --> 00:21:59.800
If that's true,

00:21:59.800 --> 00:22:04.540
I may have aided a devil's revival, 
without even realizing it.

00:22:07.000 --> 00:22:09.810
This is the end!

00:23:49.380 --> 00:23:52.180
Yuya, let's defeat Leo Akaba together.

00:23:52.590 --> 00:23:56.580
Once he's defeated, I will save you!

00:23:56.960 --> 00:23:59.320
Which is that? Z-ARC?

00:23:59.320 --> 00:24:00.250
Or...

00:24:00.680 --> 00:24:01.940
Is it Yuya?

00:24:02.420 --> 00:24:06.770
I will soon become one and 
retake my original self.

00:24:06.770 --> 00:24:08.960
To do that, I must bury him!

00:24:10.330 --> 00:24:13.800
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
Parts of the Supreme King.

00:24:14.420 --> 00:24:16.030
The fun is only getting started!
